          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} about private sound baths, events, and VIP days in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f1724;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);--glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--accent:#9be7ff;--muted:#b8c6d3;--card-radius:14px}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial;color:var(--muted);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071126 0%, #081827 60%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    body::before{content:\\\"\\\";position:fixed;inset:0;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');opacity:0.12;mix-blend-mode:screen}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}\\n    header{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffffff14,transparent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(3,10,18,0.6) inset}\\n    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:16px;color:#e6f7ff}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}\\n    main{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:var(--card-radius);padding:28px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}\\n    h2.title{color:#e8faff;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:20px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),var(--glass-2));padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#cfeefc;margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);background:transparent;color:#eaf8ff}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .muted{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    aside{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7de7ff,#5ab0ff);color:#02313c;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{grid-column:1/-1;margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .testi{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}\\n    .flow{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}\\n    .flow li{padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted)}\\n    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#ffcfcf;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,110,110,0.06),transparent);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden>♪</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Quiet luxury · sensory-led sound experiences</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private Sessions</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our Story</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Questions</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <h2 class=\\\"title\\\">Connect with {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Whether you're booking a VIP Day, reserving a private 1:1, or planning a venue evening at {{VENUE_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, reach out below — we respond within 48 hours.</p>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px\\\">\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0;color:#e8faff\\\">How we work — an overview</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Our sessions are intentional, multi-sensory gatherings combining sound, breath, and light touch guidance. We design each meeting with a premium, slow-paced aesthetic — soft lighting, plush blankets, aromatic notes, and curated instruments.</p>\\n\\n          <h4 style=\\\"color:#dff8ff;margin:12px 0 6px 0\\\">What to bring</h4>\\n          <ul class=\\\"muted\\\">\\n            <li>Comfortable clothing, layers for temperature shifts</li>\\n            <li>Your own mat or yoga blanket (we provide extras on request)</li>\\n            <li>Eye pillow or small scarf for gentle darkness</li>\\n            <li>Reusable water bottle</li>\\n          </ul>\\n\\n          <h4 style=\\\"color:#dff8ff;margin:12px 0 6px 0\\\">Contraindications & safety</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Sound therapy is gentle, but consult us if you have:</p>\\n          <ul class=\\\"muted\\\">\\n            <li>Recent or unstable cardiac conditions</li>\\n            <li>Epilepsy or photosensitive conditions</li>\\n            <li>Severe psychiatric conditions without therapist approval</li>\\n            <li>Pregnancy — reach out to discuss modifications</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div class=\\\"disclaimer\\\">This page is informational and not medical advice. Please contact your healthcare provider for personalized guidance.</div>\\n\\n          <h4 style=\\\"color:#dff8ff;margin:12px 0 6px 0\\\">Typical session flow</h4>\\n          <ol class=\\\"flow\\\">\\n            <li>Arrival & settling: herbal tea, short intake (10–15 min).</li>\\n            <li>Intention setting & gentle breathwork (5–10 min).</li>\\n            <li>Sound journey (30–60 min) using a tailored mix of instruments.</li>\\n            <li>Slow re-entry with silence, grounding prompts, and reflection (10–15 min).</li>\\n            <li>Post-session notes & booking follow-up.</li>\\n          </ol>\\n\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Instruments used here vary by offering — crystal bowls, chimes, gong swells, tuning forks, and a tuned monochord are commonly woven into private and group experiences.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <aside>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#cff6ff\\\">Quick contact</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:600;color:#e9fcff\\\">{{PHONE}}</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">or</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:600;color:#e9fcff\\\">{{EMAIL}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"pill\\\">VIP Day · Bespoke</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Ideal for corporate retreats or deep private work</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"testi\\\">“A luminous, well-held soundscape — the most restorative hour I’ve had in years.”</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#cceff8\\\">— A. R., past attendee</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\">Book a quick consult</div>\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"color:#dff8ff;margin:6px 0\\\">Frequently asked (short)</h4>\\n        <details style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px\\\">\\n          <summary style=\\\"cursor:pointer\\\">How long is a typical private session?</summary>\\n          <div style=\\\"padding-top:8px\\\">Most 1:1 sessions are 60–90 minutes. VIP Days are half-day or full-day immersive experiences; ask about customization.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px\\\">\\n          <summary style=\\\"cursor:pointer\\\">Is sound therapy safe with hearing aids?</summary>\\n          <div style=\\\"padding-top:8px\\\">Hearing aids can be worn; inform us at booking so we can moderate volume and instrument proximity.</div>\\n        </details>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <form action=\\\"/submit\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0;color:#e8faff\\\">Get in touch</h3>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Tell us about your interest and preferred dates. We offer bespoke VIP days and short private bookings.</div>\\n        <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Email</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"phone\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"type\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">I'm inquiring about</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"type\\\">\\n          <option>Group Event / Public Gathering</option>\\n          <option>Private 1:1 Session</option>\\n          <option>Couples Session</option>\\n          <option>Corporate / Retreat</option>\\n          <option>VIP Day (full or half-day)</option>\\n        </select>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"dates\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Preferred dates / window</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"dates\\\" name=\\\"dates\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. next month, or specific dates\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"message\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Message / needs</label>\\n        <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us about your group, accessibility needs, or intention...\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <input id=\\\"follow\\\" name=\\\"follow\\\" type=\\\"checkbox\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"follow\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Subscribe for event updates & the occasional guide (lead magnet)</label>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">Send inquiry</button>\\n          <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Reserve time instead</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"source\\\" value=\\\"contact-page\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">We respond within 48 hours. By contacting you consent to our small data use policy.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0;color:#e8faff\\\">Quick policies & notes</h4>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Cancellations: 48-hour notice requested for full refund on private bookings. For VIP Days, see our custom contract terms provided on inquiry.</div>\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0;color:#e8faff\\\">Location</h4>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Most sessions held at {{VENUE_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. On-site or off-site options are possible for corporate bookings.</div>\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0;color:#e8faff\\\">Group size</h4>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Public gatherings are curated for 12–28 people depending on the room; private sessions are 1–6 for deep work.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </form>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <div>© <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> • Sensory sound baths in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Questions? Call {{PHONE}} or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Chunk 4 — contact page and notes\\n\\nThis bundle contains two files for the sound bath site (slug: sound_bath-2026-02-16T12-56-36-179Z-025).\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — The contact / inquiry page, built with a glass-morphism aesthetic and a sensory-first copy tone (practical_guide voice). Includes: hero/contact header, safety & contraindications, what to bring, session flow, short FAQ, lead magnet prompt, and an inquiry form. Placeholders used where required: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}, {{VENUE_NAME}}, {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}.\\n\\n- README.md — this file (you are reading it).\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout family: glass_morphism — implemented via translucent cards, backdrop-filter blur, and subtle gradients.\\n- Visual richness is achieved purely with CSS and references to an external SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg (ensure that file exists in the final build).\\n- Navigation labels vary from other pages (e.g., \\\"Gatherings\\\", \\\"Private Sessions\\\", \\\"Rates\\\", \\\"Questions\\\", \\\"Reserve\\\", \\\"Connect\\\") to satisfy uniqueness rules.\\n- The copy includes safety/contraindication guidance and a full session flow as required by the sound bath rules.\\n- Instruments are referenced with variety (crystal bowls, chimes, gong, tuning forks, monochord) rather than repeating any single list.\\n\\nDeveloper notes:\\n- Form action is a placeholder (/submit); wire to your backend or serverless endpoint.\\n- Keep assets/img/pattern.svg present and unique per project requirement.\\n- This chunk intentionally avoids external fonts or CDNs.\\n\\nSeed: 1776066116\\nLayoutFamily: glass_morphism\\nVoiceFamily: practical_guide\\nOfferModel: vip_day\\n\\nIf you need edits (different CTA phrasing, alternate form fields, or additional accessibility attributes), ask specifying the change.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
